code: cfg-inline-refused
when-fires: a function call could not be inlined. cfg.rs — SEVEN distinct emit paths under one slug: redefinition, recursion, inline-depth budget, unmodeled positional in body, unmodeled write-redirect in body (tc-M2), per-call node budget, per-book node budget. Each names its own reason.
why: the call runs as an ordinary unmodeled command (MustRun, safe). PASSTHROUGH — the per-path reason rides `detail`.
